## Out of scope

- No SKILL.md behavior changes.
- No rendered prompt content changes.
- No `/implement` Step 2 feature-coder instrumentation.
- No hard-required completeness entry in `docs/run-logs-required-files.tsv`.
- No instrumentation of decompose, plan_scout, or plan-autofix launches.

